\\ A residual request can appear inside an expression; run waits rather than
\\ pretending there was a reply.
\\ > host request 0: Store.put 41
\\ > outcome: none (waiting for the host's reply; run has no host)
(effect Store durable (put I64 --> I64))
(define main {I64 --> I64} input -> (+ (perform Store put 41) 1))
